spectrag: an unofficial implementation of SpectRAG
==================================================

This package is an independent, unofficial implementation of the method described in:

  Zafer Sahinoglu, Abdulazeez Mohammed, Buse Yaren Kazangirler and Cahit Berkay Kazangirler.
  SpectRAG: Weighted Chunk Graphs for Token-Budgeted Context Selection in Multi-Hop
  Retrieval-Augmented Generation. arXiv:2610.36991, 2026. https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.36991

It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the paper's authors.

The official implementation by the authors is:

  https://github.com/SightAndCite/SpectRAG
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 The SpectRAG Authors

This package was written from the paper. It does not include code from the official
implementation. The method, its equations, tables and default values are the work of the
paper's authors; please cite the paper if you use the method.

